## Connector capabilities

1. What resources does the connector sync?
- The Atlassian connector syncs Users, Groups and Workspaces.

2. Can the connector provision any resources? If so, which ones?
- At the moment, this connector is unable to provision resources.

## Connector credentials

1. What credentials or information are needed to set up the connector? (For example, API key, client ID and secret, domain, etc.)
- For this connector, an access-token and the ID of the Atlassian Organization are required. The flags are 'access-token' and 'organization-id'

2. For each item in the list above:

   * How does a user create or look up that credential or info? Please include links to (non-gated) documentation, screenshots (of the UI or of gated docs), or a video of the process.
    - For the access token the user should go their admin.atlassian.com site of the desired organization and search for the "Setting" tab.
      When selected, a side menu on the left side of the screen should be visible with a section named after "API Keys". In that section, users will be able to generate the Keys.
      Atlassian Support Guide to create API Keys: https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/manage-an-organization-with-the-admin-apis/

   * Does the credential need any specific scopes or permissions? If so, list them here.
    - The user should be an admin of the org, and the key should be created with "no scopes" in order to access the needed API Endpoints and resources.
    (some specific scopes may be required when including provisioning at this connector)

   * If applicable: Is the list of scopes or permissions different to sync (read) versus provision (read-write)? If so, list the difference here.
   - This doesn't apply when the API Key is generated with an admin user and "no scopes" specified.

   * What level of access or permissions does the user need in order to create the credentials? (For example, must be a super administrator, must have access to the admin console, etc.)
   - It should be an admin of the organization.